detail/territory-sales-executive-job-in-coimbatore-at-genevix-equipments-india-private-limited1788395478","experience":"1 year(s)"},{"title":"Sales Coordinator","company":"FISHER PUMPS Private Limited","location":"Coimbatore","date_posted":"2026-09-03","url":"https://internshala.com/job/detail/sales-coordinator-job-in-coimbatore-at-fisher-pumps-private-limited1788420180","experience":"1 year(s)"},{"title":"Sales Executive","company":"Spirezen Enterprises Private Limited","location":"Coimbatore","date_posted":"2026-09-06","url":"https://internshala.com/job/detail/fresher-sales-executive-job-in-coimbatore-at-spirezen-enterprises-private-limited1788654685"},{"title":"Business Development Executive  EdTech / STEM","company":"TriHusLab","location":"Coimbatore","date_posted":"2026-09-07","url":"https://internshala.com/job/detail/fresher-business-development-executive-edtech-stem-job-in-coimbatore-at-trihuslab1788481897","experience":"Fresher","skills":[103,105,106,107],"is_walkin":false,"description":"**Business Development Executive – EdTech / STEM** \n\n\n\n\n**Location:** \n Coimbatore, Tamil Nadu\n \n\n\n\n**Company:** \n TriHusLab\n \n\n\n\n**Employment Type:** \n Full\\-time\n \n\n\n\n**Experience:** \n Freshers \\& experienced candidates can apply\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n About TriHusLab\n \n\n\n\n TriHusLab is an education and design\\-technology company working with schools to introduce practical, project\\-based learning through\n **STEM/STREAM, design, digital fabrication, creative technology and hands\\-on learning programmes** \n .\n \n\n\n\n We work with schools to create engaging learning experiences that expose students to design, technology, engineering and real\\-world applications.\n \n\n\n\n We are looking for a\n **Business Development Executive based in Coimbatore** \n who can help us connect with schools, introduce our programmes and develop new business opportunities across the region.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n Role \\& Responsibilities\n \n\n\n\n The selected candidate will:\n \n\n\n* Make cold calls to schools and introduce TriHusLab's programmes and services\n* Identify the appropriate decision\\-makers such as principals, coordinators and school management\n* Follow up with interested schools and schedule meetings/demonstrations\n* Visit schools within Coimbatore and nearby regions for in\\-person meetings\n* Conduct product/programme presentations and demonstrations after training\n* Make cold walk\\-ins to potential schools where appropriate\n* Generate and develop new school leads\n* Follow up consistently with prospective schools\n* Maintain clear records of calls, meetings, demos and lead status\n* Coordinate with the internal team regarding quotations, proposals and follow\\-ups\n* Support other team members with business\\-development activities where required\n* Build relationships with schools and identify potential partnerships/referral opportunities\n* Provide regular updates on leads, conversations and market feedback\n\n\n\n Who Can Apply?\n \n\n\n\n We are open to\n **fresh graduates as well as candidates with previous experience** \n .\n \n\n\n\n Prior sales or marketing experience is\n **NOT mandatory** \n . Training and guidance regarding our products, presentations and sales process will be provided.\n \n\n\n\n We would particularly prefer candidates from backgrounds such as:\n \n\n\n* Engineering – BE/BTech\n* Electronics / Electrical / Mechanical / Computer Science\n* Architecture / Design\n* Science / Technology\n* Education / EdTech\n* MBA / BBA candidates with an interest in technology and education\n* Other relevant technical or educational backgrounds\n\n\n\n The most important requirement is the ability to\n **understand our programmes and confidently explain them to schools** \n .\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n Skills We're Looking For\n \n\n\n* Good spoken English\n* Strong communication and interpersonal skills\n* Confidence speaking with school management and decision\\-makers\n* Willingness to make cold calls and follow up consistently\n* Comfortable visiting schools and giving presentations/demos\n* Basic understanding or interest in STEM, technology, design or education\n* Ability to learn technical/product information\n* Self\\-motivated and organised\n* Comfortable coordinating with a remote/internal team\n* Willingness to travel within Coimbatore and nearby areas\n\n\n\n Freshers Are Welcome\n \n\n\n\n If you are a fresher with a technical/educational background and are interested in\n **business development, EdTech and working directly with schools** \n , we encourage you to apply.\n \n\n\n\n You do not need previous sales experience.\n \n\n\n\n We are willing to train the right candidate on:\n \n\n\n* Our products and programmes\n* School presentations\n* Product demonstrations\n* Lead generation\n* Sales follow\\-ups\n* Business\\-development processes\n\n\n\n We are primarily looking for someone who is\n **proactive, confident, willing to learn and comfortable meeting people** \n .\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n Travel\n \n\n\n\n This is a field\\-oriented role.\n \n\n\n\n The candidate should be comfortable travelling to schools across\n **Coimbatore and surrounding areas** \n for meetings, demonstrations and business\\-development activities.\n \n\n\n\n Travel requirements and reimbursements will be discussed during the interview.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n To Apply\n \n\n\n\n Please apply with your updated resume and a short introduction covering:\n \n\n\n* Your educational background\n* Current location\n* Any experience interacting with schools/educational institutions\n* Your interest in EdTech/STEM/design education\n* Whether you are comfortable with cold calling, school visits and giving demonstrations\n* Your availability to join\n* We are looking for someone who would like to\n **learn, take ownership of a region and grow along with the company.**"},{"title":"Business Development Executive","company":"AVMLabs","location":"Coimbatore","date_posted":"2026-09-07","url":"https://internshala.com/job/detail/fresher-business-development-executive-job-in-coimbatore-at-avmlabs1786536150","is_walkin":false},{"title":"Business Development Associate","company":"Cornixe","location":"Coimbatore","date_posted":"2026-09-08","url":"https://internshala.com/job/detail/fresher-business-development-associate-job-in-multiple-locations-at-cornixe1788841246","is_walkin":false},{"title":"Sales Executive","company":"Spirezen Enterprises Private Limited","location":"Coimbatore","date_posted":"2026-09-06","url":"https://internshala.com/job/detail/fresher-sales-executive-job-in-coimbatore-at-spirezen-enterprises-private-limited1788654685"},{"title":"Corporate Sales Trainee","company":"Srini Corporation","location":"Coimbatore","date_posted":"2026-09-08","url":"https://internshala.com/job/detail/fresher-corporate-sales-trainee-job-in-coimbatore-at-srini-corporation1788853912","is_walkin":false},{"title":"Sales Executive","company":"CHN Technologies","location":"Coimbatore","date_posted":"2026-09-09","url":"https://internshala.com/job/detail/fresher-sales-executive-job-in-coimbatore-at-chn-technologies1788966136","is_walkin":false},{"title":"Assistant Sales Coordinator","company":"Energy Fitness And Sports","location":"Coimbatore","date_posted":"2026-09-10","url":"https://internshala.com/job/detail/assistant-sales-coordinator-job-in-multiple-locations-at-energy-fitness-and-sports1788938817","experience":"1 year(s)","is_walkin":false}]